# Build context of frontend/Dockerfile (T-PLT-36, RNF-PLT-01, design.md §3.4.2).
# No environment file ever enters an image, .env.example included (no exception on purpose).
**/.env*
# Version control and local tooling.
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/.idea
# Installed and generated: the image installs its own node_modules and runs its own build.
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
# The image does not need its own recipe.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
